<title>USA: MHC extends Chateau tender offer.</title>
<headline>MHC extends Chateau tender offer.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manufactured Home Communities Inc. Wednesday extended its cash tender offer of $26 per share, worth about $400 million, for rival mobile home park operator Chateau Properties Inc. until Oct. 23.</p>
